Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 02:02:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 02/25] Ibasho LEAP APIs: IM, objects, building, money, social

New LEAP APIs for driving the viewer as a resident without UI clicking:
- IbashoIM: send to avatar/group/session, sessions, history, conference.
- IbashoObjects: nearby objects with names, hover text, owners, perms,
  sale info (throttled ObjectPropertiesFamily requests, cached), full
  properties via selection, select/deselect, buy.
- IbashoBuild: create/modify/duplicate/rez/link/unlink/take/delete prims
  directly by object id, no selection needed.
- IbashoAgent: balance, pay (capped by IbashoMaxPayment and optional
  IbashoMaxSessionSpend), give, attach/detach to a point, friendship and
  teleport offers, groups, set home, parcel info, people, friends, names.
Events (IMs in/out, object IMs, money, created objects, properties) go to
the IbashoEvents pump, which the viewer creates itself.

Core files only get one-line hooks (ibashohooks.h).
